  - m_Id: 1000050
    m_Localized: Summons a large, sturdy rock golem that fights only ground enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000051
    m_Localized: Places a trap that arms when an enemy steps in, then stuns the area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000052
    m_Localized: Places a totem that stops nearby allied buildings from decaying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000053
    m_Localized: Builds a tower that lobs shells and blows up where they land.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000054
    m_Localized: Builds a structure that keeps spreading leaf fields around it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000055
    m_Localized: Builds a tower that fires flame shots at both ground and air targets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000056
    m_Localized: Summons a serpent that leaves water fields where it moves and fires
      a water beam through every enemy in a line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000057
    m_Localized: Drains your own units down to half health and fires a beam that
      deals 70% of what it took, split over four hits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000058
    m_Localized: Fires a warhead that homes in on the nearest air target, or the
      nearest ground target when there is none.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000059
    m_Localized: Hurls a boulder that knocks its target back and deals extra damage
      when the target slams into a wall or another enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000060
    m_Localized: Summons a flying sprite that drops bombs on ground targets and blows
      them up where they land.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000061
    m_Localized: Plants a giant vine, then grows two rings of vines around it a moment
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
